    "regime_notes": "Daily effect is positive in 2020-22 (IC 0.04118, ICIR 0.1212), 2023-25 (0.03304, 0.1008), and 2026-30 (0.01524, 0.0505). Multi-day signed decay is negative, so this is a short-horizon overlay rather than a multi-day standalone signal. Small 15-asset universe implies conservative uncertainty interpretation.",
